                "shell": "Walls about 5 cm thick, as the Dufuna canoe's (en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dufuna_canoe). Carved from one log, a side stands from the bottom with its gunwale free, and a breaker bends it as a cantilever: by the model, 8.6 voxels from the bottom's edge to the gunwale"
